<title>UK: UK'S ALPHA AIRPORTS NAMES NEW CHIEF CEO.</title>
<headline>UK'S ALPHA AIRPORTS NAMES NEW CHIEF CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British airport services group Alpha Airports Group Plc said on Tuesday it had appointed Kevin Abbott as its chief executive with effect from October 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Abbott succeeds Paul Harrison who has joined banking group Standard Chartered Plc.</p>
<p>Abbott has been a director of Rexam Plc, initially responsible for international packaging and then for global food and beverages packaging.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
